{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Carl Burton, the creator of  IGF Finalist <i>Islands: Non-Places, <strong>MIRRIA</strong></i> is an atmospheric casual puzzle game where players navigate a strange, cryptic world that blurs the line between dream and reality. Using inspection and memory, players uncover hidden anomalies between mirrored worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DREAMLIKE WORLDBUILDING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome is a self-contained story. These\u00a0 mysterious progressions invite the player to\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >imagine a strange, interconnected world.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/dd3d914380141e6bfe9b79cdd5a4e40d.poster.avif?t=1765386317\" width=614 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/dd3d914380141e6bfe9b79cdd5a4e40d.webm?t=1765386317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/dd3d914380141e6bfe9b79cdd5a4e40d.mp4?t=1765386317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HANDCRAFTED, INFINITELY REPLAYABLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area is replayable with unique solutions every time. Completing levels unlock new biomes, each revealing a world steeped in quiet atmosphere and ambient mystery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/9d6d9a841f8f7aee17d0fed7374b3d3a.poster.avif?t=1765386317\" width=614 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/9d6d9a841f8f7aee17d0fed7374b3d3a.webm?t=1765386317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/9d6d9a841f8f7aee17d0fed7374b3d3a.mp4?t=1765386317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A UNIQUE TWIST ON A BELOVED GENRE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mirria reimagines the simplicity of spot-the-difference game mechanics with mysterious, hand-crafted environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/b59869b10a3d702c1b63ccf761167fbf.poster.avif?t=1765386317\" width=614 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/b59869b10a3d702c1b63ccf761167fbf.webm?t=1765386317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/b59869b10a3d702c1b63ccf761167fbf.mp4?t=1765386317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A DISTINCTIVE ART STYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A handcrafted aesthetic by artist Carl Burton. Instantly recognizable and emotionally resonant. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURPRISING AND INTUITIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a surreal, ever-evolving world where every area is unexpected, but the controls and goals are always intuitive. You\u2019re never lost, only intrigued.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/9159ad56e904bbf16e6d02088e316c57.poster.avif?t=1765386317\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/